{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-84","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"To a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole only one straight line can be annexed which is incommensurable in square with the whole straight line and which with the whole straight line makes the sum of the squares on them medial and twice the rectangle contained by them both medial and also incommensurable with the sum of the squares on them.","book":10,"number":84,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":84,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","contentId":"euclid-10-84","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8c8e74faa8bf2268d9d7f097430f7f6935ca92af776548c90039810a59c36c29","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-84.statement","euclid-10-84.construction.1","euclid-10-84.proof.1","euclid-10-84.proof.2","euclid-10-84.construction.2","euclid-10-84.proof.3","euclid-10-84.proof.4","euclid-10-84.proof.5","euclid-10-84.proof.6","euclid-10-84.proof.7","euclid-10-84.proof.8","euclid-10-84.proof.9","euclid-10-84.proof.10","euclid-10-84.proof.11","euclid-10-84.proof.12","euclid-10-84.proof.13","euclid-10-84.conclusion","euclid-10-84.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-84.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"32bc6f05cec156f5d4cbac4ce9011273e394cda6eb09508304c7465fecad22ee","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole only one straight line can be annexed which is incommensurable in square with the whole straight line and which with the whole straight line makes the sum of the squares on them medial and twice the rectangle contained by them both medial and also incommensurable with the sum of the squares on them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线以中项无理线段个区域产生中项无理线段个整条线,但只能附1条直线,即正方形的不可公度整条直线,而整条直线使正方形直线的中项无理线段和矩形的2倍于中项无理线段和不可公度的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ef5920d2be233c806122377d9773db59ae38f880ab5722b62c8bb6315805eb0","citations":["euclid-10-78"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole, and BC an annex to it; therefore AC, CB are straight lines incommensurable in square which fulfil the aforesaid conditions. [[X. 78](/principles/euclid-10-78)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AB线作为中项无理线段个区域中项无理线段整片的直线,BC为该直线的附件;因此,AC条CB是正方形不可公度直线,符合上述条件。 [[X. 78](/principles/euclid-10-78)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dacc99aefb96867603088bbb6969b6de4a1907fbff5949fb93245cb1af54f6c6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that no other straight line can be annexed to AB which fulfils the aforesaid conditions."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,不符合上述条件的AB线不能附着任何其他直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba3d0e3fc37c20f752f309f2503b7b908053027e1802e26e3ef59edb45b6e03b","citations":["euclid-10-78"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let BD be so annexed, so that AD, DB are also straight lines incommensurable in square which make the squares on AD, DB added together medial, twice the rectangle AD, DB medial, and also the squares on AD, DB incommensurable with twice the rectangle AD, DB. [[X. 78](/principles/euclid-10-78)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,BD可以作为附件,这样,正方形的AD、DB也是直线不可公度,使正方形在AD、DB上加在一起中项无理线段,是矩形AD、DB、中项无理线段的两倍,也是正方形AD、DB、不可公度,是矩形AD、DB和DB的两倍。 [[X. 78](/principles/euclid-10-78)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"549bdfecd3f172daed072f97ec838a7d919557f031194e972ca76ba5f553bc80","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a rational straight line EF be set out, let EG equal to the squares on AC, CB be applied to EF, producing EM as breadth, and let HG equal to twice the rectangle AC, CB be applied to EF, producing HM as breadth; therefore the remainder, the square on AB [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)], is equal to EL; therefore AB is the side of EL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出有理线段 EF,EG等于正方形,AC,CB适用于EF,宽度扩大为EM,HG等于矩形,AC,CB适用于EF,宽度扩大为HM;因此,其余的正方形等于AB,EL;因此,AB是EL的一边。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5fbe421c2f6672288f0ff32f80605804115feb3f3d7310d4dee4d76737e516e3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let EI equal to the squares on AD, DB be applied to EF, producing EN as breadth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,EI等于AD,DB适用于EF,宽度扩大为EN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"437ebf44c1dc33eb6140c3434cca7a9287a4c1df4d7e6c31c62ced9d8b0e3934","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on AB is also equal to EL; therefore the remainder, twice the rectangle AD, DB [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)], is equal to HI."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB的正方形也等于EL,因此其余的为矩形ADDB的两倍,等于HI。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87575e58a203e47d1a5c7e2cc08564d74d6c4ff2c6f66afd81ebd5d5f06bf3f2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the sum of the squares on AC, CB is medial and is equal to EG, therefore EG is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AC比正方形,CB等于中项无理线段,等于EG,因此EG也等于中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6232364a88cb53832277c3bbbf47330ecee665b336dd19626ea9bcd544f45ee9","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line EF, producing EM as breadth; therefore EM is rational and incommensurable in length with EF. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到EM宽,因此,EM长为有理,不可公度长为EF。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c98b5910c35f23a1d9ddaa163a1a0d677935982546a608fbde1388694b744c42","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since twice the rectangle AC, CB is medial and is equal to HG, therefore HG is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于矩形 AC中有两倍是中项无理线段,相当于HG,因此HG也是中项无理线段。（相关点与线段：CB）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de3418f06b720ed0bc340d2734602671ac3bb0ce2a11987917a3e38412d5671a","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line EF, producing HM as breadth; therefore HM is rational and incommensurable in length with EF. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到HM宽,因此,HM长为有理,不可公度长为EF。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e4732c9b65c40267ebce75bb83bb4e31fb29f8ee6526992963d3cea1d849f414","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the squares on AC, CB are incommensurable with twice the rectangle AC, CB, EG is also incommensurable with HG; therefore EM is also incommensurable in length with MH. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有自AC正方形起,CB起为不可公度起,矩形起为AC起的两倍,CB起为EG起,EG起为不可公度起,HG起为HG起;因此,EM的长度也是不可公度,为MH。[ 音 ] [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"064da788a1b30242e781029327525041534b5c97c90a0107a7070f1bbbb384f0","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore EM, MH are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore EH is an apotome, and HM an annex to it. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,EM,MH是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,EH是截差无理线段,HM是其附件。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"486b1afc5256712c8d57d32faab155a352f9b94a0cfcc16c9202eb2848b651a1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that EH is again an apotome and HN an annex to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,EH是其附件截差无理线段和HN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f798c073bfbe34809970487698c31982ba9bb55e0fbb5d7e77af41e27043be3c","citations":["euclid-10-79"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore to an apotome different rational straight lines are annexed which are commensurable with the wholes in square only: which was proved impossible. [[X. 79](/principles/euclid-10-79)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,截差无理线段种不同的有理线段种被附在附件,可公度种,仅以正方形种整件:这证明是不可能的。 [[X. 79](/principles/euclid-10-79)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c76a4d34c1087df7fb7340325efccfc01bfe2fef7cdb4a8822e064b98ee0138e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no other straight line can be so annexed to AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,其他直线不能附于AB之后。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":16,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f6e3035f2049226599d05b0df7d272a038ad2d508d6deffceedb5d908579008","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore to AB only one straight line can be annexed which is incommensurable in square with the whole and which with the whole makes the squares on them added together medial, twice the rectangle contained by them medial, and also the squares on them incommensurable with twice the rectangle contained by them. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,只有一条直线可附在AB,即正方形的不可公度整条,而整个正方形直线加起来,是中项无理线段的两倍,也是中项无理线段的两倍,不可公度的正方形和矩形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-84.source","contentId":"euclid-10-84","revisionId":"euclid-10-84@raw-8c8e74faa8bf2268","order":17,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"efc470280ab5b7b90dbb0c50ca6176a6184ca75d481c00b079a1fd73329c80ad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-10-78:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-84","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-84.construction.1","euclid-10-84.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-78","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84/","sourceLabel":"X. 78"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-2-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-84","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-84.construction.2","euclid-10-84.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84/","sourceLabel":"II. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-10-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-84","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-84.proof.6","euclid-10-84.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84/","sourceLabel":"X. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-84","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-84.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-10-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-84","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-84.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84/","sourceLabel":"X. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-10-73:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-84","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-84.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-73","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84/","sourceLabel":"X. 73"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-10-79:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-84","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-84.proof.12"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-79","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.84/","sourceLabel":"X. 79"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-10-78:explicit","id":"euclid-10-78","book":10,"number":78,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-2-7:explicit","id":"euclid-2-7","book":2,"number":7,"kind":"proposition","title":"线段平方与矩形面积恒等式","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-10-22:explicit","id":"euclid-10-22","book":10,"number":22,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-6-1:explicit","id":"euclid-6-1","book":6,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"同高三角形与平行四边形的面积比等于底边比","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-10-11:explicit","id":"euclid-10-11","book":10,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"比例关系保持可公度与不可公度","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-10-73:explicit","id":"euclid-10-73","book":10,"number":73,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与截差无理线段与无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-84:euclid-10-79:explicit","id":"euclid-10-79","book":10,"number":79,"kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：可公度量与截差无理线段与平方","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-irrational","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
